    "specSha256": "4e690529dc0866daa9956411336d980b948e53ee2b73a25cea4dbb075614ea9d",
    "criterion": "更新冲突与范围，必要时调整并保留待确认方案；不沿用被替代来源的唯一正确答案，也不假定主会话已同步。已确认方案受新材料实质影响时明确重新确认受影响内容。",
    "supplementalCriterion": null
  },
  "criteria": [
    {
      "id": "E7_clarified_four_turn_continuity_and_real_selection",
      "status": "PASS",
      "rationale": "四轮真实连续同UUID。T1给目标，T2合法澄清资格替换范围，T3自然说明替换原§2–§3其余保留；模型据此重给真实A/B/C，并继续等待。T4实际确认T3目标A后才交付。来源范围确认与目标确认两件事分开，没有用嵌套题号作为目标标识。",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "turn": 1,
          "path": "C:\\Users\\Admin\\.codex\\worktrees\\html-guide-acceptance\\reviewer\\corrections\\0-1-3\\expanded\\runs\\35cbc054-c182-4f65-a19e-979933b9c2a0\\E7-clarified\\92398f88-7cc2-4b3b-a51b-3c91508fb9ea\\01.output.txt",
          "line": 11,
          "excerpt": "### A. 访客操作判断"
        },
        {
          "turn": 1,
          "path": "C:\\Users\\Admin\\.codex\\worktrees\\html-guide-acceptance\\reviewer\\corrections\\0-1-3\\expanded\\runs\\35cbc054-c182-4f65-a19e-979933b9c2a0\\E7-clarified\\92398f88-7cc2-4b3b-a51b-3c91508fb9ea\\01.output.txt",
          "line": 46,
          "excerpt": "请明确回复“选择 A / B / C”，或给出修改后的读者、使用任务和理解问题，并明确确认采用。确认前我不会继续编排指南。"
        },
        {
          "turn": 2,
          "path": "C:\\Users\\Admin\\.codex\\worktrees\\html-guide-acceptance\\reviewer\\corrections\\0-1-3\\expanded\\runs\\35cbc054-c182-4f65-a19e-979933b9c2a0\\E7-clarified\\92398f88-7cc2-4b3b-a51b-3c91508fb9ea\\02.output.txt",
          "line": 10,
          "excerpt": "你说“原先资格部分由新材料替换”，尚不能确定替换范围是："
        },
        {
          "turn": 2,
          "path": "C:\\Users\\Admin\\.codex\\worktrees\\html-guide-acceptance\\reviewer\\corrections\\0-1-3\\expanded\\runs\\35cbc054-c182-4f65-a19e-979933b9c2a0\\E7-clarified\\92398f88-7cc2-4b3b-a51b-3c91508fb9ea\\02.output.txt",
          "line": 15,
          "excerpt": "请明确回复“范围 1”或“范围 2”，也可以自行界定替换范围。当前仍未确认任何目标方案；范围明确后，我会更新目标选项并继续等待你确认，不会自行选择版本或开始编排指南。"
        },
        {
          "turn": 3,
          "path": "C:\\Users\\Admin\\.codex\\worktrees\\html-guide-acceptance\\reviewer\\corrections\\0-1-3\\expanded\\runs\\35cbc054-c182-4f65-a19e-979933b9c2a0\\E7-clarified\\92398f88-7cc2-4b3b-a51b-3c91508fb9ea\\03.input.txt",
          "line": 1,
          "excerpt": "这里的资格部分是替换原修订1的§2–§3，其余§1、§4–§8保留；D1与D2仍没有权威顺序。请据此重新提供本轮的读者、使用任务和理解问题目标。"
        },
        {
          "turn": 3,
          "path": "C:\\Users\\Admin\\.codex\\worktrees\\html-guide-acceptance\\reviewer\\corrections\\0-1-3\\expanded\\runs\\35cbc054-c182-4f65-a19e-979933b9c2a0\\E7-clarified\\92398f88-7cc2-4b3b-a51b-3c91508fb9ea\\03.output.txt",
          "line": 13,
          "excerpt": "### A. 冲突条件下的访客判断"
        },
        {
          "turn": 3,
          "path": "C:\\Users\\Admin\\.codex\\worktrees\\html-guide-acceptance\\reviewer\\corrections\\0-1-3\\expanded\\runs\\35cbc054-c182-4f65-a19e-979933b9c2a0\\E7-clarified\\92398f88-7cc2-4b3b-a51b-3c91508fb9ea\\03.output.txt",
          "line": 49,
          "excerpt": "请明确回复“选择 A / B / C”，或提交修改后的目标并明确确认采用。当前仍为待确认状态，尚未开始编排指南。"
        },
        {
          "turn": 4,
          "path": "C:\\Users\\Admin\\.codex\\worktrees\\html-guide-acceptance\\reviewer\\corrections\\0-1-3\\expanded\\runs\\35cbc054-c182-4f65-a19e-979933b9c2a0\\E7-clarified\\92398f88-7cc2-4b3b-a51b-3c91508fb9ea\\04.input.txt",
          "line": 1,
          "excerpt": "我明确选择并确认 A，按该方案编排指南。"
        },
        {
          "turn": 4,
          "path": "C:\\Users\\Admin\\.codex\\worktrees\\html-guide-acceptance\\reviewer\\corrections\\0-1-3\\expanded\\runs\\35cbc054-c182-4f65-a19e-979933b9c2a0\\E7-clarified\\92398f88-7cc2-4b3b-a51b-3c91508fb9ea\\04.output.txt",
          "line": 7,
          "excerpt": "**读者**  "
        },
        {
          "turn": 4,
          "path": "C:\\Users\\Admin\\.codex\\worktrees\\html-guide-acceptance\\reviewer\\corrections\\0-1-3\\expanded\\runs\\35cbc054-c182-4f65-a19e-979933b9c2a0\\E7-clarified\\92398f88-7cc2-4b3b-a51b-3c91508fb9ea\\04.output.txt",
          "line": 11,
          "excerpt": "分别按照 D1 与 D2 判断资格条件是否满足，同时识别仅凭现有材料不能完成的状态判断。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "E7_clarified_replaced_sources_conflict_and_known_unknown_boundaries",
      "status": "PASS",
      "rationale": "原§2–§3明确移出当前依据，D1且/D2或无权威排序并列保留；旧核验转换不再补缺。共同局部结论、冲突与当前状态下明确§4领取规则分开，未知限定为进入已核验的转换和完整路径；不把路径缺口扩成所有直接操作未知，也不假定主会话同步。",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "turn": 3,
          "path": "C:\\Users\\Admin\\.codex\\worktrees\\html-guide-acceptance\\reviewer\\corrections\\0-1-3\\expanded\\runs\\35cbc054-c182-4f65-a19e-979933b9c2a0\\E7-clarified\\92398f88-7cc2-4b3b-a51b-3c91508fb9ea\\03.output.txt",
          "line": 3,
          "excerpt": "- 保留：修订 1 的 §1、§4–§8。"
        },
        {
          "turn": 3,
          "path": "C:\\Users\\Admin\\.codex\\worktrees\\html-guide-acceptance\\reviewer\\corrections\\0-1-3\\expanded\\runs\\35cbc054-c182-4f65-a19e-979933b9c2a0\\E7-clarified\\92398f88-7cc2-4b3b-a51b-3c91508fb9ea\\03.output.txt",
          "line": 4,
          "excerpt": "- 移除：修订 1 的 §2–§3，不再作为现行规则依据。"
        },
        {
          "turn": 3,
          "path": "C:\\Users\\Admin\\.codex\\worktrees\\html-guide-acceptance\\reviewer\\corrections\\0-1-3\\expanded\\runs\\35cbc054-c182-4f65-a19e-979933b9c2a0\\E7-clarified\\92398f88-7cc2-4b3b-a51b-3c91508fb9ea\\03.output.txt",
          "line": 9,
          "excerpt": "- 由此产生关键缺口：保留的 §4 要求访客处于“已核验”才能领取，但替换材料没有说明如何进入“已核验”、核验失败如何反馈，以及核验是否改变库存。现阶段不能补造这些规则。"
        },
        {
          "turn": 4,
          "path": "C:\\Users\\Admin\\.codex\\worktrees\\html-guide-acceptance\\reviewer\\corrections\\0-1-3\\expanded\\runs\\35cbc054-c182-4f65-a19e-979933b9c2a0\\E7-clarified\\92398f88-7cc2-4b3b-a51b-3c91508fb9ea\\04.output.txt",
          "line": 24,
          "excerpt": "- 《活动材料包领取说明，修订 1》的 §1、§4–§8。"
        },
        {
          "turn": 4,
          "path": "C:\\Users\\Admin\\.codex\\worktrees\\html-guide-acceptance\\reviewer\\corrections\\0-1-3\\expanded\\runs\\35cbc054-c182-4f65-a19e-979933b9c2a0\\E7-clarified\\92398f88-7cc2-4b3b-a51b-3c91508fb9ea\\04.output.txt",
          "line": 26,
          "excerpt": "- 原修订 1 的 §2–§3 已被替换，不再作为当前规则依据。"
        },
        {
          "turn": 4,
          "path": "C:\\Users\\Admin\\.codex\\worktrees\\html-guide-acceptance\\reviewer\\corrections\\0-1-3\\expanded\\runs\\35cbc054-c182-4f65-a19e-979933b9c2a0\\E7-clarified\\92398f88-7cc2-4b3b-a51b-3c91508fb9ea\\04.output.txt",
          "line": 30,
          "excerpt": "- **D1 §2**：预约有效**且**导览完成，缺一不可。"
        },
        {
          "turn": 4,
          "path": "C:\\Users\\Admin\\.codex\\worktrees\\html-guide-acceptance\\reviewer\\corrections\\0-1-3\\expanded\\runs\\35cbc054-c182-4f65-a19e-979933b9c2a0\\E7-clarified\\92398f88-7cc2-4b3b-a51b-3c91508fb9ea\\04.output.txt",
          "line": 31,
          "excerpt": "- **D2 §2**：预约有效**或**导览完成，两项中满足一项即可。"
        },
        {
          "turn": 4,
          "path": "C:\\Users\\Admin\\.codex\\worktrees\\html-guide-acceptance\\reviewer\\corrections\\0-1-3\\expanded\\runs\\35cbc054-c182-4f65-a19e-979933b9c2a0\\E7-clarified\\92398f88-7cc2-4b3b-a51b-3c91508fb9ea\\04.output.txt",
          "line": 33,
          "excerpt": "两者没有批准记录、有效日期或权威优先关系。教材必须并列显示，不能选定其中一份为有效版本。"
        },
        {
          "turn": 4,
          "path": "C:\\Users\\Admin\\.codex\\worktrees\\html-guide-acceptance\\reviewer\\corrections\\0-1-3\\expanded\\runs\\35cbc054-c182-4f65-a19e-979933b9c2a0\\E7-clarified\\92398f88-7cc2-4b3b-a51b-3c91508fb9ea\\04.output.txt",
          "line": 40,
          "excerpt": "替换后的材料没有说明如何从“未核验”变成“已核验”，也没有说明资格判断与“已核验”状态之间的转换关系。因此："
        },
        {
          "turn": 4,
          "path": "C:\\Users\\Admin\\.codex\\worktrees\\html-guide-acceptance\\reviewer\\corrections\\0-1-3\\expanded\\runs\\35cbc054-c182-4f65-a19e-979933b9c2a0\\E7-clarified\\92398f88-7cc2-4b3b-a51b-3c91508fb9ea\\04.output.txt",
          "line": 43,
          "excerpt": "- 可以依据 §4 判断某个已知访客状态是否允许直接操作“领取”；"
        },
        {
          "turn": 4,
          "path": "C:\\Users\\Admin\\.codex\\worktrees\\html-guide-acceptance\\reviewer\\corrections\\0-1-3\\expanded\\runs\\35cbc054-c182-4f65-a19e-979933b9c2a0\\E7-clarified\\92398f88-7cc2-4b3b-a51b-3c91508fb9ea\\04.output.txt",
          "line": 44,
          "excerpt": "- 不能仅因满足 D1 或 D2，就断言访客已经“已核验”；"
        },
        {
          "turn": 4,
          "path": "C:\\Users\\Admin\\.codex\\worktrees\\html-guide-acceptance\\reviewer\\corrections\\0-1-3\\expanded\\runs\\35cbc054-c182-4f65-a19e-979933b9c2a0\\E7-clarified\\92398f88-7cc2-4b3b-a51b-3c91508fb9ea\\04.output.txt",
          "line": 45,
          "excerpt": "- 不能由现有材料构造从初始状态到成功领取的完整路径。"
        },
        {
          "turn": 4,
          "path": "C:\\Users\\Admin\\.codex\\worktrees\\html-guide-acceptance\\reviewer\\corrections\\0-1-3\\expanded\\runs\\35cbc054-c182-4f65-a19e-979933b9c2a0\\E7-clarified\\92398f88-7cc2-4b3b-a51b-3c91508fb9ea\\04.output.txt",
          "line": 76,
          "excerpt": "- 仅满足一项时，D1 判为不满足，D2 判为满足，结果不能合并成唯一资格结论。"
        },
        {
          "turn": 4,
          "path": "C:\\Users\\Admin\\.codex\\worktrees\\html-guide-acceptance\\reviewer\\corrections\\0-1-3\\expanded\\runs\\35cbc054-c182-4f65-a19e-979933b9c2a0\\E7-clarified\\92398f88-7cc2-4b3b-a51b-3c91508fb9ea\\04.output.txt",
          "line": 87,
          "excerpt": "| 是 | 否 | 不满足 | 满足 | 冲突 |"
        },
        {
          "turn": 4,
          "path": "C:\\Users\\Admin\\.codex\\worktrees\\html-guide-acceptance\\reviewer\\corrections\\0-1-3\\expanded\\runs\\35cbc054-c182-4f65-a19e-979933b9c2a0\\E7-clarified\\92398f88-7cc2-4b3b-a51b-3c91508fb9ea\\04.output.txt",
          "line": 89,
          "excerpt": "| 是 | 是 | 满足 | 满足 | 一致 |"
        },
        {
          "turn": 4,
          "path": "C:\\Users\\Admin\\.codex\\worktrees\\html-guide-acceptance\\reviewer\\corrections\\0-1-3\\expanded\\runs\\35cbc054-c182-4f65-a19e-979933b9c2a0\\E7-clarified\\92398f88-7cc2-4b3b-a51b-3c91508fb9ea\\04.output.txt",
          "line": 119,
          "excerpt": "| 其他状态 | 任意 | 不可领取 | 材料未进一步规定被拒操作后的状态和库存变化 |"
        },
        {
          "turn": 4,
          "path": "C:\\Users\\Admin\\.codex\\worktrees\\html-guide-acceptance\\reviewer\\corrections\\0-1-3\\expanded\\runs\\35cbc054-c182-4f65-a19e-979933b9c2a0\\E7-clarified\\92398f88-7cc2-4b3b-a51b-3c91508fb9ea\\04.output.txt",
          "line": 126,
          "excerpt": "- §4 对已知状态下的单次领取操作有明确规则，但材料缺少到达“已核验”的规则。"
        },
        {
          "turn": 4,
          "path": "C:\\Users\\Admin\\.codex\\worktrees\\html-guide-acceptance\\reviewer\\corrections\\0-1-3\\expanded\\runs\\35cbc054-c182-4f65-a19e-979933b9c2a0\\E7-clarified\\92398f88-7cc2-4b3b-a51b-3c91508fb9ea\\04.output.txt",
          "line": 133,
          "excerpt": "- **取消（§6）**：领取前可以取消预约；预约变为无效，访客状态回到“未核验”，导览完成情况和库存不变。“已领取”或“已归还”时取消不可用。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "E7_clarified_simulation_feedback_recovery_and_text_boundary",
      "status": "PASS",
      "rationale": "条件比较器同时显示D1/D2局部结果，不给唯一资格或自动核验；教学设置的状态库存明说不一定能从初值到达，§4局部领取判断没有承诺整条路径。反馈解释逻辑和来源、允许改答/清除旧反馈；开放路径问题仅给参考不评分，恢复按保留的§7/§1，聊天文本没有HTML或代码、写入或长期掌握宣称。",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "turn": 4,
          "path": "C:\\Users\\Admin\\.codex\\worktrees\\html-guide-acceptance\\reviewer\\corrections\\0-1-3\\expanded\\runs\\35cbc054-c182-4f65-a19e-979933b9c2a0\\E7-clarified\\92398f88-7cc2-4b3b-a51b-3c91508fb9ea\\04.output.txt",
          "line": 59,
          "excerpt": "> 本教材比较两份没有优先关系的规则。模拟结果只表示“按某份来源是否满足资格表达”，不表示已完成核验、领取成功或现实活动允许领取。"
        },
        {
          "turn": 4,
          "path": "C:\\Users\\Admin\\.codex\\worktrees\\html-guide-acceptance\\reviewer\\corrections\\0-1-3\\expanded\\runs\\35cbc054-c182-4f65-a19e-979933b9c2a0\\E7-clarified\\92398f88-7cc2-4b3b-a51b-3c91508fb9ea\\04.output.txt",
          "line": 78,
          "excerpt": "这里的“满足／不满足”必须写成“满足 D1 的资格表达”或“满足 D2 的资格表达”，不能直接缩写成“可以领取”。"
        },
        {
          "turn": 4,
          "path": "C:\\Users\\Admin\\.codex\\worktrees\\html-guide-acceptance\\reviewer\\corrections\\0-1-3\\expanded\\runs\\35cbc054-c182-4f65-a19e-979933b9c2a0\\E7-clarified\\92398f88-7cc2-4b3b-a51b-3c91508fb9ea\\04.output.txt",
          "line": 150,
          "excerpt": "同时显示 D1、D2 的原始条件关系及“没有权威优先关系”的提示。"
        },
        {
          "turn": 4,
          "path": "C:\\Users\\Admin\\.codex\\worktrees\\html-guide-acceptance\\reviewer\\corrections\\0-1-3\\expanded\\runs\\35cbc054-c182-4f65-a19e-979933b9c2a0\\E7-clarified\\92398f88-7cc2-4b3b-a51b-3c91508fb9ea\\04.output.txt",
          "line": 159,
          "excerpt": "这只是教学条件模拟，不表示真实预约或导览状态已被改变。"
        },
        {
          "turn": 4,
          "path": "C:\\Users\\Admin\\.codex\\worktrees\\html-guide-acceptance\\reviewer\\corrections\\0-1-3\\expanded\\runs\\35cbc054-c182-4f65-a19e-979933b9c2a0\\E7-clarified\\92398f88-7cc2-4b3b-a51b-3c91508fb9ea\\04.output.txt",
          "line": 170,
          "excerpt": "结果严格采用第四节的四行条件表，不输出合并后的最终资格结论。"
        },
        {
          "turn": 4,
          "path": "C:\\Users\\Admin\\.codex\\worktrees\\html-guide-acceptance\\reviewer\\corrections\\0-1-3\\expanded\\runs\\35cbc054-c182-4f65-a19e-979933b9c2a0\\E7-clarified\\92398f88-7cc2-4b3b-a51b-3c91508fb9ea\\04.output.txt",
          "line": 175,
          "excerpt": "- 仅一项为是：解释 D1 因缺少另一项而不满足，D2 因已有一项满足而满足；由于没有优先规则，不能唯一决定采用哪份结论。"
        },
        {
          "turn": 4,
          "path": "C:\\Users\\Admin\\.codex\\worktrees\\html-guide-acceptance\\reviewer\\corrections\\0-1-3\\expanded\\runs\\35cbc054-c182-4f65-a19e-979933b9c2a0\\E7-clarified\\92398f88-7cc2-4b3b-a51b-3c91508fb9ea\\04.output.txt",
          "line": 176,
          "excerpt": "- 两项均是：解释 D1 的两项要求均满足，D2 的至少一项要求也满足；但这仍不能证明已经“已核验”。"
        },
        {
          "turn": 4,
          "path": "C:\\Users\\Admin\\.codex\\worktrees\\html-guide-acceptance\\reviewer\\corrections\\0-1-3\\expanded\\runs\\35cbc054-c182-4f65-a19e-979933b9c2a0\\E7-clarified\\92398f88-7cc2-4b3b-a51b-3c91508fb9ea\\04.output.txt",
          "line": 180,
          "excerpt": "“恢复初始条件”应将预约恢复为无效、导览恢复为未完成，并清除上一组合的反馈。它只恢复本次教学模拟，不执行现实操作。"
        },
        {
          "turn": 4,
          "path": "C:\\Users\\Admin\\.codex\\worktrees\\html-guide-acceptance\\reviewer\\corrections\\0-1-3\\expanded\\runs\\35cbc054-c182-4f65-a19e-979933b9c2a0\\E7-clarified\\92398f88-7cc2-4b3b-a51b-3c91508fb9ea\\04.output.txt",
          "line": 217,
          "excerpt": "教材应说明，状态和库存的选择用于检查规则分支，不表示这些组合一定能从初始状态到达。"
        },
        {
          "turn": 4,
          "path": "C:\\Users\\Admin\\.codex\\worktrees\\html-guide-acceptance\\reviewer\\corrections\\0-1-3\\expanded\\runs\\35cbc054-c182-4f65-a19e-979933b9c2a0\\E7-clarified\\92398f88-7cc2-4b3b-a51b-3c91508fb9ea\\04.output.txt",
          "line": 231,
          "excerpt": "- §4：在给定的“已核验”状态与库存条件下，领取会变为“已领取”，库存减少 1；"
        },
        {
          "turn": 4,
          "path": "C:\\Users\\Admin\\.codex\\worktrees\\html-guide-acceptance\\reviewer\\corrections\\0-1-3\\expanded\\runs\\35cbc054-c182-4f65-a19e-979933b9c2a0\\E7-clarified\\92398f88-7cc2-4b3b-a51b-3c91508fb9ea\\04.output.txt",
          "line": 232,
          "excerpt": "- 限制：材料不能解释该访客如何进入“已核验”，也不能解决 D1 与 D2 的冲突。"
        },
        {
          "turn": 4,
          "path": "C:\\Users\\Admin\\.codex\\worktrees\\html-guide-acceptance\\reviewer\\corrections\\0-1-3\\expanded\\runs\\35cbc054-c182-4f65-a19e-979933b9c2a0\\E7-clarified\\92398f88-7cc2-4b3b-a51b-3c91508fb9ea\\04.output.txt",
          "line": 234,
          "excerpt": "这不是对整条业务路径的肯定，只是分别报告各条规则对当前输入的局部结论。"
        },
        {
          "turn": 4,
          "path": "C:\\Users\\Admin\\.codex\\worktrees\\html-guide-acceptance\\reviewer\\corrections\\0-1-3\\expanded\\runs\\35cbc054-c182-4f65-a19e-979933b9c2a0\\E7-clarified\\92398f88-7cc2-4b3b-a51b-3c91508fb9ea\\04.output.txt",
          "line": 238,
          "excerpt": "允许改选任一条件；改选后旧反馈立即失效。使用“重新开始”时恢复 §1 的全部初始值，并明确这是 §7 的教学演示恢复方式。"
        },
        {
          "turn": 4,
          "path": "C:\\Users\\Admin\\.codex\\worktrees\\html-guide-acceptance\\reviewer\\corrections\\0-1-3\\expanded\\runs\\35cbc054-c182-4f65-a19e-979933b9c2a0\\E7-clarified\\92398f88-7cc2-4b3b-a51b-3c91508fb9ea\\04.output.txt",
          "line": 253,
          "excerpt": "提交后显示理由及 D1 §2、D2 §2 的来源定位，并允许修改答案后重新提交。"
        },
        {
          "turn": 4,
          "path": "C:\\Users\\Admin\\.codex\\worktrees\\html-guide-acceptance\\reviewer\\corrections\\0-1-3\\expanded\\runs\\35cbc054-c182-4f65-a19e-979933b9c2a0\\E7-clarified\\92398f88-7cc2-4b3b-a51b-3c91508fb9ea\\04.output.txt",
          "line": 273,
          "excerpt": "采用开放说明，不评分、不判定长期掌握。参考思路包括："
        },
        {
          "turn": 4,
          "path": "C:\\Users\\Admin\\.codex\\worktrees\\html-guide-acceptance\\reviewer\\corrections\\0-1-3\\expanded\\runs\\35cbc054-c182-4f65-a19e-979933b9c2a0\\E7-clarified\\92398f88-7cc2-4b3b-a51b-3c91508fb9ea\\04.output.txt",
          "line": 281,
          "excerpt": "读者修改回答后，旧反馈应清除或标记为失效。"
        },
        {
          "turn": 4,
          "path": "C:\\Users\\Admin\\.codex\\worktrees\\html-guide-acceptance\\reviewer\\corrections\\0-1-3\\expanded\\runs\\35cbc054-c182-4f65-a19e-979933b9c2a0\\E7-clarified\\92398f88-7cc2-4b3b-a51b-3c91508fb9ea\\04.output.txt",
          "line": 291,
          "excerpt": "- 不设置总分、“资格已确认”或“已经掌握”等超出证据范围的结论。"
        },
        {
          "turn": 4,
          "path": "C:\\Users\\Admin\\.codex\\worktrees\\html-guide-acceptance\\reviewer\\corrections\\0-1-3\\expanded\\runs\\35cbc054-c182-4f65-a19e-979933b9c2a0\\E7-clarified\\92398f88-7cc2-4b3b-a51b-3c91508fb9ea\\04.output.txt",
          "line": 306,
          "excerpt": "12. 教材只声称支持局部规则判断，不声称已解决来源冲突、完成现实领取或证明理解改善。"
        }
      ]
